The '''Kingdom of Rose''' is the first and largest [[Locations|location]] in the [[Second Sea]]. However, this island is still far more dangerous than any other [[First Sea]] island, because the [[enemies]] attacks are stronger, and Bounty Hunting becomes more common. This island has three [[Bosses]] ([[Diamond (Boss)|Diamond]], [[Jeremy]] and [[Don Swan]]), one [[Raid Bosses|Raid Boss]] [[Core|(Core)]] and four sets of [[enemies]] ([[Swan Pirate|Swan Pirates]], [[Raider|Raiders]], [[Mercenary|Mercenaries]] and [[Factory Staff|Factory Staffs]]).

Under the black rock near the [[Raider|Raiders]] and closest to the [[Colosseum (Second Sea)|Colosseum]], there is a secret passage that leads under the whole island and goes out of an opening on the right side of the bridge. The passage is filled with water, there has a lot of chests and the [[Legendary Sword Dealer]] can spawn there sometimes.

