==Chests==
There are 28 [[chests]] in total on the Kingdom of Rose.
* 15 Silver chests
* 10 Gold chests
* 3 Diamond chests One of the diamond chests is on the large tree where [[Diamond (Boss)|Diamond]] spawns, another one being in the [[Mansion (Second Sea)|Mansion]] above all the buildings.

==Trivia==
* One of the sections of the [[Bridge]] is the largest object that [[Control]] can throw. It can hit players from the bridge to [[Green Zone]].
* The Kingdom of Rose is currently the largest island in the game.
* There is a tree that has white leaves where the [[Swan Pirate]]s spawn. 
* Returning to/joining a friend in the [[Second Sea]] from the [[First Sea]] or [[Third Sea]] will teleport the player over to Kingdom of Rose.
*If the player hasn't been to the Second sea in some time it will be set as the player's homepoint.
